Package: canivt
Title: Download and Parse StatCan Beyond 20/20 IVT Tables
Version: 0.4.1
Authors@R:
    person("Jens", "von Bergmann", , "jens@mountainmath.ca", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Downloads and parses Statistics Canada Beyond 20/20 .ivt data
    tables into tidy data frames, Parquet, or CSV, and extracts table
    metadata such as dimension members, geographic identifiers, and
    footnotes that are not part of the data itself. The data itself is
    published by Statistics Canada under the Statistics Canada Open Licence
    (<https://www.statcan.gc.ca/en/reference/licence>); a small sample table
    is bundled for examples and tests.
